{"id":"081edc5d75e10718","group":"58","path":"58/batch01/58-df-zfc-algebra2-subring.md","title":"ZFC Algebra2 Subring","display":"df-zfc-algebra2-subring — ZFC Algebra2 Subring","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-algebra2-subring","aliases":["58-df-zfc-algebra2-subring"],"display":"df-zfc-algebra2-subring — ZFC Algebra2 Subring","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch11/58-df-ring.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-algebra2-subring"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-algebra2-subring</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-algebra2-subring — ZFC Algebra2 Subring"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1c30d21ea7b443f6\" href=\"?note=1c30d21ea7b443f6\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-ring.md\">../batch11/58-df-ring.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R,+,\\cdot,0_R,1_R,S\\in V,\\ S\\subseteq R\">\\(R,+,\\cdot,0_R,1_R,S\\in V,\\ S\\subseteq R\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcAlgebra2Subring}_S:V^6\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcAlgebra2Subring}_S:V^6\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ring}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{Ring}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"1c30d21ea7b443f6\" href=\"?note=1c30d21ea7b443f6\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-ring.md\">../batch11/58-df-ring.md</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}algebra2\\text{-}subring} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcAlgebra2Subring}_S(S,R,+,\\cdot,0_R,1_R)\\leftrightarrow S\\subseteq R\\land \\operatorname{Ring}_S(R,+,\\cdot,0_R,1_R)\\land \\operatorname{Ring}_S\\!\\left(S,+\\upharpoonright(S\\times S),\\cdot\\upharpoonright(S\\times S),0_R,1_R\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}algebra2\\text{-}subring} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcAlgebra2Subring}_S(S,R,+,\\cdot,0_R,1_R)\\leftrightarrow S\\subseteq R\\land \\operatorname{Ring}_S(R,+,\\cdot,0_R,1_R)\\land \\operatorname{Ring}_S\\!\\left(S,+\\upharpoonright(S\\times S),\\cdot\\upharpoonright(S\\times S),0_R,1_R\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This is the unital-subring convention: the restricted ring on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> has the same zero and identity as <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-ring.md","status":"resolved","id":"1c30d21ea7b443f6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-ring.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-ring.md","status":"resolved","id":"1c30d21ea7b443f6","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Ring}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch11/58-df-ring.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"R,+,\\cdot,0_R,1_R,S\\in V,\\ S\\subseteq R","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcAlgebra2Subring}_S:V^6\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Ring}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}algebra2\\text{-}subring} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcAlgebra2Subring}_S(S,R,+,\\cdot,0_R,1_R)\\leftrightarrow S\\subseteq R\\land \\operatorname{Ring}_S(R,+,\\cdot,0_R,1_R)\\land \\operatorname{Ring}_S\\!\\left(S,+\\upharpoonright(S\\times S),\\cdot\\upharpoonright(S\\times S),0_R,1_R\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"R","display":false}],"bytes":990,"backlinks":[{"id":"8d50da078de7aa54","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1431","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-zfc-algebra2-subring.md|58-df-zfc-algebra2-subring]]（batch01）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","1c30d21ea7b443f6"]}